# Polyphase implementation

Goal: Deliver a polished, playable audiovisual polyomino arcade.
Architecture: deterministic TypeScript rules, Canvas board, Three.js universe, Web Audio synth.
Technology: Vite, TypeScript, Three.js, Vitest, ESLint, Prettier.

- [x] Rules: all one-through-six-cell playable shapes including mirrors; balanced custom Fusion; bags, boards, kicks, hold, ghost, drop, lock delay, lines, scoring, charge and game over. Behavior tests first.
- [x] Audio: original Korobeiniki arrangement in piece-count meters; bass, countermelody, drums, delay and responsive effects; gesture startup, mute, pause and volume.
- [x] Universe: Three.js cosmic vista with stars, aurora, luminous orbit, themes and impact reaction; reduced motion and fallback.
- [x] Interface: responsive UI, Canvas pieces and unclipped particles, shake, previews, seven modes and Fusion size mixer, settings, pause/restart, separate mix records, touch.
- [x] Integration: review lanes; build, lint, one full suite, aislop, browser playthroughs and screenshots.
- [x] Documentation: README, build instructions, TEST-REPORT and launcher; leave a runnable local server.
